&lt;li&gt;Aligns solution design with agreed architecture patterns set by the global team. Aligns work to the strategic initiatives and roadmap set by the platforms operations lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the software engineering team best practices, leadership and people management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and evolve modern digital products using C#, TypeScript, and React (as applied to Next.js and Remix).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop APIs and backend services using .NET Core and relational databases, supporting composable and data-driven architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cloud infrastructure in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AWS or Azure&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;using &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for Infrastructure as Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with &lt;strong&gt;Azure DevOps&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to automate build and deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, UX, Strategy, and DevOps specialists to co-create high-quality, outcome-focused solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate with headless SaaS tools like Contentful, DatoCMS, Prismic, Algolia, and others in the composable ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply DevOps and performance engineering practices — including caching, observability, and scalability — to deliver resilient products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our Software Engineering discipline, sharing knowledge and helping shape how we build and deliver technology at Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
