&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with C# / .NET Core, TypeScript, and React (Next.js / Remix).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good grasp of relational database design and API development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience deploying to Azure using Infrastructure as Code (Terraform).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with headless CMS and composable architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building products that are accessible, performant, secure, and user-centred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset — you value working as part of a multi-disciplinary team and learning from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
